  // REAL collectible card — the very NavitarDesign component
  // the grid below renders, with the very data cardDataFor
  // resolves for the grid — at its NATURAL size, the visual
  // twin of the same fighter's grid card. The scaled-down
  // dressed composite that used to stand here (SummonCard,
